          "short": "$5.0425\\times10^{10}\\text{ microseconds}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}t&=14\\times3600+25=50425\\text{ s}\\\\t&=50425\\times10^6\\text{ microseconds}\\\\t&=5.0425\\times10^{10}\\text{ microseconds}.\\end{aligned}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 28
